Package: kde-infinite-desktop
Architecture: all
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.kde-infinite-desktop.noeffect !pkg.kde-infinite-desktop.noapp>
Depends: kwin-effect-infinitedesktop (>= ${source:Version}),
         kde-infinite-desktop-settings (>= ${source:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends},
Replaces: kde-infinit-desktop
Conflicts: kde-infinit-desktop
Provides: kde-infinit-desktop
Description: infinite canvas for KDE Plasma (metapackage)
 KDE Infinite Desktop turns every monitor into an infinite canvas: windows
 are placed on a plane that can be panned and zoomed freely with the mouse,
 the touchpad, a touchscreen or the keyboard.
 .
 This metapackage installs the KWin effect and the settings app.

Package: kwin-effect-infinitedesktop
Architecture: linux-any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.kde-infinite-desktop.noeffect>
Depends: kde-infinite-desktop-data (= ${source:Version}),
         kwin-wayland (>= ${kwin:Version}),
         kwin-wayland (<< ${kwin:NextVersion}),
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends: kde-infinite-desktop-settings,
Replaces: kwin-effect-infinitdesktop
Conflicts: kwin-effect-infinitdesktop
Provides: kwin-effect-infinitdesktop
Description: infinite pannable and zoomable canvas - KWin effect
 KDE Infinite Desktop turns every monitor into an infinite canvas: windows
 are placed on a plane that can be panned and zoomed freely with the mouse,
 the touchpad, a touchscreen or the keyboard.
 .
 This package contains the KWin effect (Plasma 6, Wayland) and its System
 Settings module. KWin only loads plugins built for exactly its version, so
 this package depends on the KWin version it was built against and has to
 be rebuilt for every KWin update.

Package: kde-infinite-desktop-settings
Architecture: linux-any
Build-Profiles: <!pkg.kde-infinite-desktop.noapp>
Depends: kde-infinite-desktop-data (= ${source:Version}),
         qml6-module-qtquick,
         qml6-module-qtquick-controls,
         qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
         qml6-module-qtquick-effects,
         qml6-module-qtquick-shapes,
         qml6-module-qtquick-window,
         qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript,
         qt6-svg-plugins | libqt6svg6,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
Recommends: kwin-effect-infinitedesktop,
Replaces: kde-infinit-desktop-settings
Conflicts: kde-infinit-desktop-settings
Provides: kde-infinit-desktop-settings
Description: infinite pannable and zoomable canvas - settings app
 KDE Infinite Desktop turns every monitor into an infinite canvas: windows
 are placed on a plane that can be panned and zoomed freely with the mouse,
 the touchpad, a touchscreen or the keyboard.
 .
 This package contains the standalone settings app
 kde-infinite-desktop-settings.

Package: kde-infinite-desktop-data
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Replaces: kde-infinit-desktop-data
Conflicts: kde-infinit-desktop-data
Provides: kde-infinit-desktop-data
Description: infinite pannable and zoomable canvas - shared data
 KDE Infinite Desktop turns every monitor into an infinite canvas: windows
 are placed on a plane that can be panned and zoomed freely with the mouse,
 the touchpad, a touchscreen or the keyboard.
 .
 This package contains the settings schema, the D-Bus interface description
 and the translations shared by the effect and the settings app.
